e_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance."}],"target_ref":"sha256:479155de953858e60f1454491ccda2215d88a4c2780e686cdfb8422481c62d9c/papers/expository.json","target_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["reference"],"rationale":"Reports the additional smooth positive-density conclusion and directs its derivation to the source corollary and long record. This further-reading passage does not supply the smoothness or fixed-time replacement proof."}],"to":"sha256:93145ef5687bb57439b6b2cb17b3f040069f7144f8a92e8bed7d3d18237af961/papers/expository.md/sha256:479155de953858e60f1454491ccda2215d88a4c2780e686cdfb8422481c62d9c/papers/expository.json/passages/density-and-approximation"},{"annotation_basis":"shared_claim_ids","derived":true,"from":"sha256:267b41919f95376c728c2f90f5c80e4bf7aa13ca3418d4931ff608c908902e54/papers/short.md/sha256:cfbe950801fd334d8fd957243fa3b1f716ef609148c5f2ff97d44f9a6443d82c/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","id":"shared-claims:8c33c98ceebb516709823850f3221d54ede0046e78291bb0222a82b2a051290a","kind":"shared_claim","selection_relation":"outgoing","shared_claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"source_field":"passages.claim_ids","source_ref":"sha256:cfbe950801fd334d8fd957243fa3b1f716ef609148c5f2ff97d44f9a6443d82c/papers/short.json","source_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d941